usage: run.py [-h] --host HOST --sdk-header SDK_HEADER --selection SELECTION
              --driver {metal,vulkan} [--metadata METADATA] [--output OUTPUT]
              [--cases {all,original}] [--prepare-only]

Bind an explicit new host/SDK pair and run two original System native cases.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --host HOST
  --sdk-header SDK_HEADER
  --selection SELECTION
  --driver {metal,vulkan}
  --metadata METADATA   defaults to HOST.controlled_build.json
  --output OUTPUT       fresh output directory; existing directory is refused
  --cases {all,original}
  --prepare-only        bind and snapshot inputs; no host execution, GPU or
                        DSO compilation
